        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《神的名字》是一款2D战棋战斗的日系角色扮演游戏。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >交流反馈</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群号：684137415</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果遇到问题欢迎来反馈吐槽、辱骂开发者。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您的每一个建议都对我十分宝贵！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >目前版本已更新战斗内存档功能。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >剧情</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >二十三章王道向剧情，二十小时以上游戏流程。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >部分角色介绍</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >路克</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作主人公。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >路克生活的世界是一个“女神”统治人类的世界结构，这种结构已经持续了上万年。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >原本路克只是一名平凡的冒险者，但是在一次机缘巧合下被女主角莉娅所救，并且从莉娅口中得知了这个世界不为人知的一面。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为了报答莉娅，也为了自己的妹妹，路克决定协助莉娅达成她的某个“目的”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >之后在与莉娅的共同行动中，他们也一步步揭露了世界的真相，并逐渐改变这个世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/07ea4e5fbea016d9eef928c6c53a3c83.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >莉娅</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >谜一般的少女，在某次“意外”中救下了路克，之后和路克一起为达成某个“目的”而展开行动。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/a20edcc4fe250eb7cab3f547c18672bd.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >莉洁忒</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >路克的妹妹，拥有很高的学习术式才能，在某一天被迷之组织所盯上……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/5364f8941316176f0dbed4b7131e6dd0.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >阿卡狄</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >风之女神，平时完全没有女神的样子，总是喜欢跑到郊外摸鱼。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/ebb129e2615306a9a4965ebefca15c54.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >赫斯提亚</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >火之女神，由于火之国遍地都是魔兽，需要不断讨伐魔兽的赫斯提亚在女神中也拥有着最高一档的战斗力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/f41fc48b48e5c8ee0ee9f1d5f8b36b88.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >瑟曦</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >幻之女神，与迷之组织的创建者有着某种交易，因此成为路克一行人的敌人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/f21c70ccd4f8a87e0cc2770ca6477794.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >露薇</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >谜之组织的核心成员之一，拥有凌驾于所有女神之上的战斗能力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >出于某种理由，违背组织的方针而在暗中协助路克一行人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/f37473045023c465716b8956d6153200.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >其他剧情中出现的可控角色共有50余名……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >战斗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >策略战棋玩法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/679ffb1edde84901342ef6fef5c22349.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/e8e147c165d5c440ad499c15b6b6d082.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/c41a31362e37cb81eb87c99fcd4647c0.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拥有五十余可控角色、八十余种类敌人、百余种技能，后期最多可出战十四名角色。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >部分可控角色展示</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/51447f91d50322321907197ddd023f03.avif?t=1758736685\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras_big/51447f91d50322321907197ddd023f03.avif?t=1758736685 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >部分普通敌人展示</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/278d4adf16a794ceedd0337d8084cf1e.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1400 height=1400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >部分强敌展示</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/d2e8ff01c10e4eb87cfbfca06d40967c.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1400 height=1600 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >十种职业</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战士：属性最为平衡的职业，同时拥有不错的生存与输出能力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >法师：拥有丰富AOE技能的法系输出，擅长快速清理聚集到一起的敌人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >牧师：中后期不可缺少的辅助型职业。除了基本的回复魔法外，还拥有多种强化友方的技能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剑士：高闪避、高暴击的物理输出，强力的剑士角色甚至可以在无伤情况下单骑讨伐敌人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >重装：极高物防、高血量，拥有职业特技『强化反击』。适合在前线吸人敌人火力，但是需要注意重装职业一般不擅长防御魔法。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >圣骑：高魔防，拥有职业特技『强化反击』。物魔双修，可以根据情况装备物理或法系魔晶技能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >狂战：拥有极高的血量与物攻，但双防与命中极低，适合配合牧师角色行动。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >刺客：极高物攻、高命中、高暴击、高移动，擅长应对单独行动的低物防强敌。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >射手：高物攻、高射程、高命中，适合在安全的地方杀伤敌方。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >萨满：极高命中，拥有多种弱化敌方的技能，适合装备弱化型魔晶应对强敌。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >养成</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >共有等级、魔晶（装备）、道具三个模块的养成系统。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >等级</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过战斗获取经验值，提升等级以提高角色基础属性；</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔晶</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          财之章解锁商店后可在商店购买获取。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          为角色提供主动技能、修正基础属性；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          魔晶的主动技能分为输出、辅助两大类，用于弥补角色短板或强化角色长处。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          魔晶附加的主动技能使用时不消耗行动力与SP，但有冷却时间。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/695e158d7cbd02c499d765941d5353b2.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >道具</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可作为战斗中有次数限制的强力对策手段来在合适时机使用。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/7f5306a25e7336a67299c2cf74c48695.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >音乐</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >合计百余首战斗、故事BGM。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >关于开发者</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >作者是个单人开发的死宅，成分比较复杂——轨迹迷、战棋爱好者、galgame爱好者、动漫爱好者、武侠迷、历史迷。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望可以通过这个游戏，与广大日系角色扮演与战棋游戏爱好者一起分享自己构建的游戏世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因为资源与能力有限，游戏还有很多不足之处，还望能多多包涵，作者会尽力完善。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >个人比较满意的游戏内容是剧情的氛围营造、战棋策略与爽度、音乐三个点。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果您通过这款游戏体会到了足够的乐趣，还希望您可以给个好评支持。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《神的名字》是一款2D战棋战斗的日系角色扮演游戏。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >交流反馈</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群号：684137415</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果遇到问题欢迎来反馈吐槽、辱骂开发者。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您的每一个建议都对我十分宝贵！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >目前版本已更新战斗内存档功能。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >剧情</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >二十三章王道向剧情，二十小时以上游戏流程。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >部分角色介绍</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >路克</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作主人公。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >路克生活的世界是一个“女神”统治人类的世界结构，这种结构已经持续了上万年。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >原本路克只是一名平凡的冒险者，但是在一次机缘巧合下被女主角莉娅所救，并且从莉娅口中得知了这个世界不为人知的一面。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为了报答莉娅，也为了自己的妹妹，路克决定协助莉娅达成她的某个“目的”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >之后在与莉娅的共同行动中，他们也一步步揭露了世界的真相，并逐渐改变这个世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/07ea4e5fbea016d9eef928c6c53a3c83.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >莉娅</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >谜一般的少女，在某次“意外”中救下了路克，之后和路克一起为达成某个“目的”而展开行动。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/a20edcc4fe250eb7cab3f547c18672bd.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >莉洁忒</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >路克的妹妹，拥有很高的学习术式才能，在某一天被迷之组织所盯上……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/5364f8941316176f0dbed4b7131e6dd0.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >阿卡狄</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >风之女神，平时完全没有女神的样子，总是喜欢跑到郊外摸鱼。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/ebb129e2615306a9a4965ebefca15c54.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >赫斯提亚</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >火之女神，由于火之国遍地都是魔兽，需要不断讨伐魔兽的赫斯提亚在女神中也拥有着最高一档的战斗力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/f41fc48b48e5c8ee0ee9f1d5f8b36b88.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >瑟曦</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >幻之女神，与迷之组织的创建者有着某种交易，因此成为路克一行人的敌人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/f21c70ccd4f8a87e0cc2770ca6477794.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >露薇</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >谜之组织的核心成员之一，拥有凌驾于所有女神之上的战斗能力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >出于某种理由，违背组织的方针而在暗中协助路克一行人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/f37473045023c465716b8956d6153200.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >其他剧情中出现的可控角色共有50余名……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >战斗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >策略战棋玩法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/679ffb1edde84901342ef6fef5c22349.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/e8e147c165d5c440ad499c15b6b6d082.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/c41a31362e37cb81eb87c99fcd4647c0.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拥有五十余可控角色、八十余种类敌人、百余种技能，后期最多可出战十四名角色。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >部分可控角色展示</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/51447f91d50322321907197ddd023f03.avif?t=1758736685\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras_big/51447f91d50322321907197ddd023f03.avif?t=1758736685 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >部分普通敌人展示</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/278d4adf16a794ceedd0337d8084cf1e.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1400 height=1400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >部分强敌展示</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/d2e8ff01c10e4eb87cfbfca06d40967c.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1400 height=1600 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >十种职业</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战士：属性最为平衡的职业，同时拥有不错的生存与输出能力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >法师：拥有丰富AOE技能的法系输出，擅长快速清理聚集到一起的敌人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >牧师：中后期不可缺少的辅助型职业。除了基本的回复魔法外，还拥有多种强化友方的技能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剑士：高闪避、高暴击的物理输出，强力的剑士角色甚至可以在无伤情况下单骑讨伐敌人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >重装：极高物防、高血量，拥有职业特技『强化反击』。适合在前线吸人敌人火力，但是需要注意重装职业一般不擅长防御魔法。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >圣骑：高魔防，拥有职业特技『强化反击』。物魔双修，可以根据情况装备物理或法系魔晶技能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >狂战：拥有极高的血量与物攻，但双防与命中极低，适合配合牧师角色行动。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >刺客：极高物攻、高命中、高暴击、高移动，擅长应对单独行动的低物防强敌。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >射手：高物攻、高射程、高命中，适合在安全的地方杀伤敌方。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >萨满：极高命中，拥有多种弱化敌方的技能，适合装备弱化型魔晶应对强敌。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >养成</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >共有等级、魔晶（装备）、道具三个模块的养成系统。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >等级</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过战斗获取经验值，提升等级以提高角色基础属性；</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔晶</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          财之章解锁商店后可在商店购买获取。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          为角色提供主动技能、修正基础属性；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          魔晶的主动技能分为输出、辅助两大类，用于弥补角色短板或强化角色长处。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          魔晶附加的主动技能使用时不消耗行动力与SP，但有冷却时间。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/695e158d7cbd02c499d765941d5353b2.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >道具</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可作为战斗中有次数限制的强力对策手段来在合适时机使用。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617020/extras/7f5306a25e7336a67299c2cf74c48695.avif?t=1758736685\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >音乐</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >合计百余首战斗、故事BGM。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >关于开发者</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >作者是个单人开发的死宅，成分比较复杂——轨迹迷、战棋爱好者、galgame爱好者、动漫爱好者、武侠迷、历史迷。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望可以通过这个游戏，与广大日系角色扮演与战棋游戏爱好者一起分享自己构建的游戏世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因为资源与能力有限，游戏还有很多不足之处，还望能多多包涵，作者会尽力完善。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >个人比较满意的游戏内容是剧情的氛围营造、战棋策略与爽度、音乐三个点。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果您通过这款游戏体会到了足够的乐趣，还希望您可以给个好评支持。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "short_description": "《神的名字》是一款2D战棋战斗的日系角色扮演游戏。主人公路克生活的世界是一个“女神”统治人类的世界结构，这种结构已经持续了上万年。 原本路克只是一名平凡的冒险者，但是在一次机缘巧合下被女主角莉娅所救，并且从莉娅口中得知了这个世界不为人知的一面。 为了报答莉娅，路克决定协助莉娅达成她的某个“目的”。之后在与莉娅的共同行动中，他们也一步步揭露了世界的真相，并逐渐改变这个世界。",
